(The ledger's input-output leaves, evening of 2026-08-29 -
 docs/ledger/input-output.md rows FMT-24, FMT-29, FMT-41, FMT-45,
 FMT-46, FMT-47, FMT-48, FMT-49, FMT-50, FMT-52, FMT-54. Same shape as
 tests/330_gen_buffers_b.vox: each leaf called directly off a pinned rng
 seed, source printed in full, at the true top level (nested false) and
 inside a block (nested true) both.

 FMT-41 needs the scratch-flag state a live program's manifest would
 have set - the same reason tests/380_gen_files_b.vox names one itself.
 Review round 3: 'gen leaf branch file handle' now opens its Otherwise
 arm inside the program's own confined scratch directory rather than at
 fd 2, so it stands aside behind 'gen leaf print' unless gen_does_file_io
 is committed and gen_scratch_flag is bound, exactly like every file leaf
 in gen_files.vox.)

Print "--- FMT-45..50: the escape table, verified byte for byte ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf escape table verified' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf escape table verified' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-24: a text reassigned from a format string ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format text reassignment' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FMT-29: buffer clear-and-refill leaves an earlier text alone ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf format value isolation' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.

Print "--- FMT-41: a file handle declared in every branch ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf branch file handle' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Set gen_does_file_io to false.

Print "--- FMT-52, FMT-54: a comma-less but-if/and-if chain ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf conditional print chain' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
